---
layout: default
title: Freediving for kids
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 mt-0 text-balance text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-7xl">Calm starts young.</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 text-xl leading-snug font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-2xl">Children learn to float, swim, glide and dive with an instructor beside them, one skill at a time.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">The dive reflex starts in the pool.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Hold your breath in water and your heart slows down on its own. The same response that keeps a diver calm at depth settles a child before a test, on a stage, at the end of a hard school day.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Breath, heart, body.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Sessions train the respiratory and cardiovascular systems and expand what the body can do in water. The child learns to move on the surface, to dive under it, and to stay safe while they are there.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">One instructor, one child.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Full attention. The pace follows who this child is and where they are &mdash; not a group average. Pool first. Open water once the basics are calm and automatic. No pushing for depth, no racing the clock.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Progress you can see.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Kids set small goals and hit them. A longer float. A cleaner duck dive. A quiet recovery after a hold. Each win is concrete, and it stacks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Parents stay in the loop.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">After sessions we talk through what changed &mdash; comfort in the water, focus, recovery &mdash; so you know how your child is developing, not just that they showed up.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Careful with the water.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">The sea is alive. Kids learn to move gently in it and leave it as they found it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="https://instagram.com/nofinsfreediving" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn mt-6">Get in touch</a>
</div>
